stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    classDef idleClass    fill:#ddeeff,stroke:#5588bb,color:#333
    classDef activeClass  fill:#ffdddd,stroke:#cc4444,color:#333
    classDef inflightClass fill:#fffacc,stroke:#b8900a,color:#333
    classDef successClass fill:#ddf5dd,stroke:#448844,color:#333
    classDef failureClass fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#aa3333,color:#555
    classDef uiClass      fill:#ede8ff,stroke:#7755aa,color:#333
    classDef tauriClass   fill:#ffecd2,stroke:#cc8844,color:#333

    backendStarting --> idle : backend-ready event
    note right of backendStarting : Tauri only.<br/>Browser starts at idle.

    idle --> recording : record<br/>(push-to-talk)
    idle --> listening : start continuous
    note left of idle : Window visibility (visible / hidden / tray)<br/>is orthogonal to recording state.<br/>Global hotkey and tray Record trigger<br/>the same transitions as the UI button.

    recording --> processing : stop<br/>(hotkey / button)

    listening : Mic open · VAD active<br/>streaming session live (v4.1)<br/>ping keepalive while silent<br/>session rotated at 1500 s
    listening --> streaming : speech start<br/>(session open, not degraded)
    listening --> processing : speech end<br/>(degraded — one-shot per utterance)
    listening --> done : stop continuous
    listening --> error : VAD failure

    streaming : Speech over live session<br/>committed text + gray tentative tail<br/>(partials never persisted)
    streaming --> streaming : forced final (120 s)<br/>text appends, FIFO untouched
    streaming --> listening : final received<br/>(utterance complete)
    streaming --> listening : VAD misfire → reset<br/>(live text cleared)
    streaming --> processing : fatal stream error, FIFO retained<br/>→ silent degrade, replay via one-shot
    streaming --> listening : fatal stream error, FIFO empty<br/>→ silent degrade
    streaming --> done : final + stop requested
    streaming --> error : decode_failure<br/>(surface — never falls back)

    state processing {
        direction TB
        connecting : connecting<br/>spinner · text empty
        receiving : receiving<br/>partial transcript visible
        connecting --> receiving
    }

    processing --> done : complete<br/>(push-to-talk /<br/>final segment)
    processing --> listening : complete<br/>(continuous)
    processing --> error : application error<br/>(inference / decode — never retried)
    processing --> listening : connection failure (continuous, VAD live)<br/>utterance WAV → recovery queue ≤ 8<br/>retry affordance · non-fatal
    processing --> done : connection failure (continuous,<br/>stop requested or VAD stopped)<br/>utterance queued · affordance persists
    listening --> processing : Retry — recovery queue<br/>replayed in order (manual only)
    done --> processing : Retry — recovery queue<br/>replayed in order (manual only)

    done --> idle : record
    error --> idle : record

    idle --> settings : open settings<br/>(gear / hotkey)
    done --> settings : open settings
    error --> settings : open settings
    settings --> idle : close settings

    class idle idleClass
    class recording activeClass
    class listening activeClass
    class streaming activeClass
    class processing inflightClass
    class done successClass
    class error failureClass
    class backendStarting tauriClass
    class settings uiClass
